Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0 (>= 2.76), libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0 (>= 3.24), libayatana-appindicator3-1 (>= 0.5.90), libjson-glib-1.0-0 (>= 1.8), libgee-0.8-2 (>= 0.20)
Installed-Size: 1024
Homepage: https://github.com/edpmath/daemonette
Description: Lightweight Linux system tray process & service manager for developers
 Daemonette is a lightweight background service and local process manager
 for Linux living in the system tray (AppIndicator). It provides instant
 service controls, real-time ANSI log monitoring, zero orphan processes
 via POSIX PGIDs, and an ultra-low memory footprint (~6 MB private RAM).
